answer=Orhan Pamuk’s Nobel lecture was entitled **“Babamın Bavulu” (“My Father's Suitcase”)**. It **“was given in Turkish.”** In it, he **“allegorically spoke of relations between Eastern and Western civilizations using the theme of his relationship with his father.”**
